y-v1.1.0-Linux.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/359238515","id":359238515,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4VaYtz","name":"Advancely-v1.1.0-macOS-Universal.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":111658276,"digest":"sha256:5fed6875cf23d4ca474b7ac1caba57b29d637e599149536510395b6c2cdb66c0","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-02-20T15:32:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T15:33:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.1.0/Advancely-v1.1.0-macOS-Universal.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/359230595","id":359230595,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4VaWyD","name":"Advancely-v1.1.0-Windows.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":107590920,"digest":"sha256:d0c36825908275c3384244764cd6431a011b8cc3c7671363cf771e03da691a43","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-02-20T15:19:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T15:20:11Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.1.0/Advancely-v1.1.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.1.0","body":"## This slightly bigger release has some very important improvements/additions:\r\n- Added a `1.13` `all_advancements` template\r\n<img width=\"2208\" height=\"1346\" alt=\"1 13 AA template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be1719f5-bbdb-4226-8385-5352940762ae\" />\r\n\r\n- and `1.11` `all_achievements` template.\r\n<img width=\"2153\" height=\"1113\" alt=\"1 11 AAch template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76a24f76-edb9-4da9-8ff9-601d572be5a8\" />\r\n\r\n- Advancely now fully supports **Arch Linux, Debian/Ubuntu and Fedora/RHEL systems**. Every release going forward will now have `.deb` and `.rpm` installers available alongside the portable `.zip` version. More info [here](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely?tab=readme-ov-file#getting-started).\r\n- Fixed copying of multi-stage goals and their stages as they would leave fields empty and making it impossible to save.\r\n- It's now possible to delete the imported language file or template after import.\r\n<img width=\"1273\" height=\"343\" alt=\"Deletion after import\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcac27d2-b62b-4e1a-aac4-7b34dbb6bc34\" />\r\n\r\n- **Full Hermes Mod Support**: By enabling the `Using Hermes Mod` setting Advancely can now decrypt and read the `advancement` and `stat` lines within the `play.log.enc` file to allow full real-time tracking. More info [here](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely?tab=readme-ov-file#core-features).\r\n- Added new option to exclusively track one specific world.\r\n- Added `Browse` buttons for both the `Track Custom Saves Path` and `Track Fixed World` path settings.\r\n<img width=\"820\" height=\"565\" alt=\"Hermes and fixed world\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ddfd783-7cb8-4491-9456-c0f58ee4b071\" />\r\n\r\n- `Auto-Track Active Instance` is now selected by default.\r\n- Added Table of Contents to the main tracker page.\r\n- Updated `settings.json` and `Default_Settings.png` in the `reference_files` folder accordingly.\r\n- Added Out-of-Bounds protection for both the overlay and tracker windows upon startup. If the windows are off the screen a warning will popup and reset the positions.\r\n<img width=\"705\" height=\"260\" alt=\"out-of-bounds\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c65f253a-1b12-40b2-a092-9eeef1b396f8\" />\r\n<img width=\"436\" height=\"155\" alt=\"out-of-bounds-overlay\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0fa3a21e-a492-40fb-b133-8fca147360ac\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [main tracker page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update!"}